{
  "_comment": "The lending journey with the morning offset (22 Sep 2026; docs/crm/runbooks/morning-offset.md). Two words do it. `offset_minutes` on the timers' window: the runs the window held overnight wake at 09:00 as always and their calls reach the dialler at once; every timer set in the first 90 minutes after the opening \u2014 a customer entering at 09:20, a held run's gap after its morning call \u2014 runs 90 minutes longer, so the day's live customers queue behind the pile instead of beside it, and after 10:30 nothing is added. Each call square says `\"await\": true` and waits for its own call's report before its plain edge is taken, so a run never has two calls queued and gap-30m counts from the call's END; `await_minutes` is the backstop, after which the queued call is aborted and the edge taken anyway. The call squares also list the merchant's topics with arrows back to the rule: a letter while the call is queued aborts that call and re-decides on the new facts (a ringing call is left to finish). A call to a phone that cannot be dialled or a blacklisted customer ends the run as ejected. The dialler's calling hours must contain the window.",
  "entry": {
    "topic": "LINE_INITIATED",
    "key": "customer_id",
    "reenter": true,
    "cooldown_hours": 0
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "is-credit-line",
      "type": "condition",
      "rules": [
        {
          "on": "yes",
          "if": [
            {
              "field": "context.products",
              "op": "not_exists"
            },
            {
              "field": "context.offers",
              "op": "exists"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "quiet-30m",
      "type": "wait",
      "topics": [
        "LINE_OFFERED",
        "LINE_OFFER_SELECTED",
        "LINE_KYC_COMPLETED",
        "LINE_LENDER_ATTEMPT_FAILED"
      ],
      "key": "$topic",
      "minutes": 30,
      "window": {
        "opens": "09:00",
        "closes": "21:00",
        "timezone": "Asia/Kolkata",
        "offset_minutes": 90
      },
      "match": {
        "run": "customer_id",
        "payload": "customer_id"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "call-1",
      "type": "call",
      "template_id": "TEMPLATE_ID_PLACEHOLDER",
      "await_minutes": 1440,
      "topics": [
        "LINE_OFFERED",
        "LINE_OFFER_SELECTED",
        "LINE_KYC_COMPLETED",
        "LINE_LENDER_ATTEMPT_FAILED"
      ],
